{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":38,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["A Psalm of David, to bring to remembrance. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 38:1"},"O LORD, rebuke me not in thy wrath: neither chasten me in thy hot displeasure. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 38:2"},"For thine arrows stick fast in me, and thy hand presseth me sore. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 38:3"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," no soundness in my flesh because of thine anger; neither ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is there any"]}," rest in my bones because of my sin. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 38:4"},"For mine iniquities are gone over mine head: as an heavy burden they are too heavy for me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 38:5"},"My wounds stink ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," are corrupt because of my foolishness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 38:6"},"I am troubled; I am bowed down greatly; I go mourning all the day long. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 38:7"},"For my loins are filled with a loathsome ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["disease:"]}," and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," no soundness in my flesh. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 38:8"},"I am feeble and sore broken: I have roared by reason of the disquietness of my heart. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 38:9"},"Lord, all my desire ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," before thee; and my groaning is not hid from thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 38:10"},"My heart panteth, my strength faileth me: as for the light of mine eyes, it also is gone from me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 38:11"},"My lovers and my friends stand aloof from my sore; and my kinsmen stand afar off. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 38:12"},"They also that seek after my life lay snares ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for me:"]}," and they that seek my hurt speak mischievous things, and imagine deceits all the day long. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 38:13"},"But I, as a deaf ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man,"]}," heard not; and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["I was"]}," as a dumb man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," openeth not his mouth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 38:14"},"Thus I was as a man that heareth not, and in whose mouth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are "]},"no reproofs. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 38:15"},"For in thee, O LORD, do I hope: thou wilt hear, O Lord my God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 38:16"},"For I said, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Hear me,"]}," lest ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["otherwise"]}," they should rejoice over me: when my foot slippeth, they magnify ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["themselves "]},"against me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 38:17"},"For I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["am"]}," ready to halt, and my sorrow ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," continually before me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 38:18"},"For I will declare mine iniquity; I will be sorry for my sin. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 38:19"},"But mine enemies ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," lively, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," they are strong: and they that hate me wrongfully are multiplied. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 38:20"},"They also that render evil for good are mine adversaries; because I follow ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["the thing that"]}," good ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 38:21"},"Forsake me not, O LORD: O my God, be not far from me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 38:22"},"Make haste to help me, O Lord my salvation. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 38:22"}]}]}
